title: Restored fundings.
subtitle: [? if ethics_hate = 2 : The O5 has restored our funding. ?][? if ethics_hate >= 3 : The O5 is restoring our funding. ?]
on-arrival: ethics_timer += 2
on-departure: funds_income += 1; ethics_hate -= 1; funds += 0.5
tags: event
view-if: ethics_hate >= 2 and ethics_committee_relation >= 75
priority: -1

The Ethics Committee has seen our corrective measures and are pleased.

They have informed the Council about us and the Council have decided to restore our funding and increase our current funds bit by bit.
